{%- comment -%}
  MY TAPE STORE — ABANDONED CHECKOUT  ·  Shopify Email "Custom Liquid" block

  WHERE THIS GOES
  Marketing > Automations > Abandoned checkout > edit the email, then:
    1. delete EVERY other block (logo, heading, text, product grid, button, divider)
    2. keep ONE Custom Liquid block
    3. paste all of this into it
  The footer carrying the unsubscribe link cannot be deleted and should not be —
  it is legally required. Everything above it is yours.

  MOBILE
  A Custom Liquid block cannot reach the document head, so there is no <style>
  block and no media queries — the layout has to be fluid instead. Nothing is
  pinned to 600px: the outer table is width="100%" with max-width, every inner
  table is 100%, and padding is 22px rather than 32px so a 320px phone still
  gets 276px of usable line. Product rows are a 64px image beside a fluid text
  column, which reflows down to 320px without a horizontal scrollbar.

  LIGHT THEME — AND ITS ONE CAVEAT
  Gmail on Android force-inverts light email and ignores every opt-out; from
  inside a Custom Liquid block there is no way to declare color-scheme. So this
  will still be re-coloured there. Two things limit the damage: every cell sets
  an explicit background (Gmail treats stated colours more predictably than
  inherited ones), and the ground is #f4f2ef rather than pure white, which
  inverts to a softer charcoal than #ffffff does.

  Contrast, measured on the surface each colour sits on:
    #1f1f1f on #ffffff 16.5:1   #555050 on #ffffff  7.5:1
    #8a8480 on #ffffff  3.5:1 (labels only)   #b62f18 on #ffffff 6.2:1
  Button label is 18px bold so white on #df3c22 (4.37:1) clears the large-text bar.
{%- endcomment -%}

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
       style="background:#f4f2ef;margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;">
  <tr><td align="center" style="padding:0;background:#f4f2ef;">

    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
           style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;">

      <!-- hazard stripe -->
      <tr><td style="height:6px;line-height:6px;font-size:0;background:#df3c22;">&nbsp;</td></tr>

      <!-- logo -->
      <tr><td align="center" style="padding:26px 22px 0 22px;background:#ffffff;">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0783/2017/3161/files/mytapestore-email-logo-560.png"
             alt="{{ shop.name }}" width="176"
             style="display:block;width:176px;max-width:60%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;">
      </td></tr>

      <!-- headline -->
      <tr><td style="padding:24px 22px 0 22px;background:#ffffff;
          font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
        <div style="display:inline-block;background:#fdeae5;color:#b62f18;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
             letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:6px;">
          Still in your cart
        </div>
        <h1 style="margin:15px 0 0 0;font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;
            letter-spacing:-0.4px;">
          You left something behind{% if customer.first_name %}, {{ customer.first_name }}{% endif %}.
        </h1>
        <p style="margin:10px 0 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#555050;">
          Your cart is saved and ready to go — pick up exactly where you left off.
        </p>
      </td></tr>

      <!-- CTA: full-width on a phone, natural width on desktop -->
      <tr><td style="padding:22px 22px 0 22px;background:#ffffff;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
          <td align="center" style="background:#df3c22;border-radius:7px;">
            <a href="{{ checkout.abandoned_checkout_url | default: abandoned_checkout_url }}"
               style="display:block;padding:16px 24px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
                      font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;">
              Return to my cart
            </a>
          </td>
        </tr></table>
      </td></tr>

      <!-- what's waiting -->
      <tr><td style="padding:28px 22px 0 22px;background:#ffffff;
          font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
        <div style="border-top:1px solid #e6e1da;padding-top:18px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
             letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8480;">
          What's waiting
        </div>
      </td></tr>

      {% for line in checkout.line_items %}
      <tr><td style="padding:14px 22px 0 22px;background:#ffffff;
          font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
          <td width="64" valign="top" style="width:64px;padding-right:14px;">
            {% if line.image %}
              <img src="{{ line.image | img_url: '128x128' }}" alt="" width="64" height="64"
                   style="display:block;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:8px;
                          border:1px solid #e6e1da;background:#ffffff;">
            {% else %}
              <div style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:8px;background:#f4f2ef;border:1px solid #e6e1da;">&nbsp;</div>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
          <td valign="middle" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;">
            <div style="font-weight:600;color:#1f1f1f;font-size:15px;">{{ line.title }}</div>
            {% if line.variant.title and line.variant.title != 'Default Title' %}
              <div style="color:#8a8480;font-size:13px;margin-top:2px;">{{ line.variant.title }}</div>
            {% endif %}
            <div style="color:#555050;font-size:13px;margin-top:2px;">Qty {{ line.quantity }}</div>
          </td>
        </tr></table>
      </td></tr>
      {% endfor %}

      <!-- bulk pricing -->
      <tr><td style="padding:24px 22px 0 22px;background:#ffffff;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
               style="background:#fdf3f1;border:1px solid #f5d9d3;border-radius:10px;">
          <tr><td style="padding:16px 18px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1f1f1f;">Buying more than one? It gets cheaper.</div>
            <div style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#555050;margin-top:5px;">
              Volume pricing applies automatically at checkout — no code needed. Most of our range steps down
              <strong style="color:#b62f18;">5%</strong> from 2 units,
              <strong style="color:#b62f18;">10%</strong> from 6, and
              <strong style="color:#b62f18;">15%</strong> from 10.
            </div>
          </td></tr>
        </table>
      </td></tr>

      <!-- help -->
      <tr><td style="padding:24px 22px 30px 22px;background:#ffffff;
          font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
        <div style="border-top:1px solid #e6e1da;padding-top:18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#555050;">
          Not sure which tape suits the job? Call us on
          <a href="tel:+61340616287" style="color:#b62f18;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">+61 3 4061 6287</a>
          — we're happy to help.
        </div>
      </td></tr>

      <tr><td style="height:6px;line-height:6px;font-size:0;background:#df3c22;">&nbsp;</td></tr>

    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
